  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productive Rural Roads Improvement Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mejora de Caminos Rurales Productivos II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es proveer acceso confiable a servicios y mercados a la poblacin rural y a la produccin forestal y agroindustrial, y los objetivos especficos: (i) mejora de la calidad de servicio de caminos departamentales productivos; y (ii) mejorar la ejecucin del gasto pblico destinado a proveer servicios de infraestructura de caminos departamentales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to provide reliable access to services and markets for the rural population and forest and agroindustrial production, and the specific objectives are: (i) improvement of the quality of service of productive departmental roads; and (ii) improvement of the execution of public spending intended to provide infrastructure services for departmental roads.</narrative>
  </description>
